With NAO seemingly down for the count, I've taken to playing locally.
After my most recent game I'd really like to figure out how to make a
ttyrec of the game.  Is there a how-to somewhere.

What prompted this was the following:

comptril the tourist descended into the dungeon.  Armed with some cool
darts, a camera, and a credit card, the first few levels were not a
challenge.  He soon came upon an alter to The Lady.  #offer some stuff
and he got the big M warhammer.   He soon found two rings that caused
peaceful monsters to attack him.  A ?ofId in a shop figured out which
one was which.

Onward to Soko.  On the 2nd lvl of Soko, a Gnomish wizard had a steel
wand. Engrave with the wand... "You may wish for an object"  WoW!!

With his fancy new armor, the rest of soko was a breeze.  A much
needed BoH was in the zoo.  Then back up to the Mines.

Minetown alter was co-aligned.  Our hero was crowned here and was
given the Vorpal Blade.  Then to mines end to grab the luck stone.  A
small problem with another gray stone down there, but fortunately he
had some holy water.

With the mines cleared our hero headed back to the main branch.  He
soon found the quest, but was too low level to proceed and continued
down the main branch.

Since he was given Vorpal upon crowning, I figured he was supposed to
use that instead of big-M.  However it seemed to do a lot less
damage.  By time he was down to Medusa I was thinking of switching
back to big-M.  Only once did Vorpy do its special beheading attack.

Anyway at Medusa a titan attacked.  Lots of nasties, but conflict
seemed to be working.  The titan hit him once but did little damage.

A couple of turns later and the tombstone appears saying he was killed
by a titan.

I'd really wanted to look more carefully at what happened.  If only
NAO was up and running.I could replay it.






